  "description": "Three reference game implementations as Flutter screens to prove the widget system works end-to-end. (1) Tic-Tac-Toe: simplest — 3x3 grid, tap to place, win detection. (2) Chess: full board with piece images, legal move highlights, drag-and-drop, promotion dialog. (3) Texas Hold'em: card hand fan, community cards, betting controls, pot display. Each plays against the server via WebSocket. Screenshot tests for visual regression.",
